2026-07-28T08:17:33.5949736Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-28T08:17:33.6013445Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-28T08:17:33.6014390Z i /tmp/RtmpDXVivw/duckdb
2026-07-28T08:17:33.6014720Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-28T08:17:33.6015087Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-28T08:17:33.6015423Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-28T08:17:33.6015927Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-28T08:17:33.6016614Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-28T08:17:33.6017158Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-28T08:17:33.6234812Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-28T08:17:33.6334290Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-28T08:17:33.6751925Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-28T08:17:33.6909122Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
